facility_id":null,"source_url":"https://www2.tceq.texas.gov/oce/eer/","checks":[{"at":"T+24h","status":"search_incomplete","note":"wind too light to trace (2.9 mph)"},{"at":"T+14d","status":"search_incomplete","note":"wind too light to trace (2.9 mph)"}],"reported":null},"corridor":{"origin_site_id":"48_201_0036","half_width_deg":22.5,"max_km":15.0,"wind_from_deg":[86.0,91.0]},"packet":{"draft_en":"On December 9, 2025, the Texas state monitor at Channelview Drive Water Tower recorded 16.05 ppb of 1,3-butadiene in the 6:00 a.m. CST hour, against a 7-day median of 0.06 ppb. HRM-3 Haden Road recorded 15.23 ppb in the same hour. Wind there came from 91 degrees at 3.3 mph. The wind was too light to trace where the air came from, so no upwind corridor is drawn. No matching report was found in the records checked; the search is incomplete. Requested follow-up: confirm whether any facility near the monitor reported a release that hour.","draft_es":"El 9 de diciembre de 2025, el monitor estatal de Texas en Channelview Drive Water Tower registró 16.05 ppb de 1,3-butadieno en la hora de las 6:00 a. m. CST, frente a una mediana de 7 días de 0.06 ppb. HRM-3 Haden Road registró 15.23 ppb en la misma hora. El viento venía de 91 grados a 3.3 mph. El viento era demasiado débil para saber de dónde venía el aire, así que no se traza un corredor. No se encontró un reporte que coincida en los registros revisados; la búsqueda está incompleta. Seguimiento solicitado: confirmar si alguna instalación cercana al monitor reportó una emisión a esa hora.","drafted_by":"template (deterministic, no AI)","guard":{"passed":true,"rejected":[]}},"cannot_say":["A matching report is not proof the facility caused every reading; other sources can add to a spike.","'Not yet reported' is not a finding about any facility: Texas requires a report only at or above a reportable quantity, and air readings cannot measure how much was released (30 TAC 101.201).","The upwind corridor comes from wind direction at one monitor (geometry only), not a dispersion model; it cannot tell facilities along the same bearing apart.","Facility coordinates are as published by EPA ECHO and may be approximate.","Only regulator-grade monitors whose data the state publishes are used (including two industry-funded Houston Regional Monitoring sites), never low-cost sensors."],"provenance":[{"file":"backtest/agc_2025_48_201_0307_43218.html","url":"https://www.tceq.texas.gov/cgi-bin/compliance/monops/agc_yearly_summary.pl","params":{"user_year":"2025","user_site":"48_201_0307","user_param":"43218","user_units":"ppb-v","report_format":"comma","user_decimals":"2"},"bytes":88649,"sha256":"0a17f200bfc5578973f8861ebafc67558bbe6d4e401f1cf1925822be0bbdbec1","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T23:59:11+00:00"},{"file":"backtest/agc_2025_48_201_0057_43218.html","url":"https://www.tceq.texas.gov/cgi-bin/compliance/monops/agc_yearly_summary.pl","params":{"user_year":"2025","user_site":"48_201_0057","user_param":"43218","user_units":"ppb-v","report_format":"comma","user_decimals":"2"},"bytes":88034,"sha256":"25c2cf6eb93814b3ba415f246fca5eb5304c964cec008621d793ef6ff36646ea","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T23:59:33+00:00"},{"file":"backtest/agc_2025_48_201_1614_43218.html","url":"https://www.tceq.texas.gov/cgi-bin/compliance/monops/agc_yearly_summary.pl","params":{"user_year":"2025","user_site":"48_201_1614","user_param":"43218","user_units":"ppb-v","report_format":"comma","user_decimals":"2"},"bytes":88640,"sha256":"0858a2973f577f16c2fcff11072db76b49e786cf45867e7b19d6b47a8317a2bf","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T23:59:56+00:00"},{"file":"backtest/agc_2025_48_201_1015_43218.html","url":"https://www.tceq.texas.gov/cgi-bin/compliance/monops/agc_yearly_summary.pl","params":{"user_year":"2025","user_site":"48_201_1015","user_param":"43218","user_units":"ppb-v","report_format":"comma","user_decimals":"2"},"bytes":87884,"sha256":"36389c0bd9414de7ad36ea7235ab7491a01c2be0ead06ba482e20f1eec5a8c10","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T00:00:42+00:00"},{"fil